<PageLayout
	title="Join us"
	eyebrow="Collaborate"
	dek="For the brands, makers and writers who share a quieter idea of luxury."
	description="Collaborate with Arahkaii — brand features, founder profiles, contributor writing, and partnerships rooted in craft, ethics and Asian storytelling."
>
	<p>
		Arahkaii is built with collaborators: the designers and founders we cover, and the
		writers who report them. If you make beautiful things thoughtfully — or write about
		those who do — we'd like to hear from you.
	</p>

	<h2>Ways to work with us</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Brand features &amp; profiles.</strong> Considered, reported pieces in the pillar voice.</li>
		<li><strong>Product launches &amp; exclusives.</strong> First looks worth a reader's attention.</li>
		<li><strong>Contributor writing.</strong> Pitches from writers fluent in modest-luxury, Asian craft and the eight pillars.</li>
		<li><strong>Creative collaborations.</strong> Photography, events and special projects.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>What we look for</h2>
	<p>
		The same three filters we hold every story to: quality (is it made with care, and
		does it last), ethics (how was it made, and by whom), and cultural fit (does it
		speak to the Asian modern-luxury reader). Per-venue verification is a standing
		requirement in Dining, Travel and Guides, and we never cover alcohol or nightlife.
	</p>

	<h2>How to reach us</h2>
	<p>
		Tell us about your brand or your writing through our
		<a href="/contact/">contact page</a> — include links to a portfolio or media kit if
		you have them. We read everything, and reply to what we can.
	</p>
</PageLayout>
